<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1207_3987.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear> was wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> liebs unnd
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> vermoegend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, from, fürsichtig ersam, wyß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innsunders</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guete</unclear> fründ unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner">Eidtgnossen</orgName>. Wir habend
<lb n="4"/>üwer schryben, darin ir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> verkündend, diewyl Gott der All-
<lb n="5"/>mechtig durch sin gnad unnd bystand, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sighaffte</unclear> eroberung der
<lb n="6"/>Statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-411" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mülhußen</unclear></placeName> verlihen unnd dieselb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fünff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Euange</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/>lischen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Orthen</unclear> in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwaltt</unclear> unnd zuo handen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gstelt</unclear>, so sehe üch nun
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathsam</unclear> unnd für <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nodtwendig</unclear> an, das wir nun unnsere <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathschleg</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zesamen</unclear> tragen unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verglichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soellind</unclear> wie man sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halb</unclear>,
<lb n="10"/>unnd der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorstanden</unclear> wehrenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgern</unclear>, verhalten welle, und das
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jedes</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">orth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> meinung unnd bedencken, uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">künfftig</unclear> donstag <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sinen</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">raths</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gsandten</unclear>, uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jetzige</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Badische</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jarrachnung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">überschicken</unclear>, die dan
<lb n="13"/>von allen meinungen ein entschluß fassen unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berathschlagen</unclear> soellind,
<lb n="14"/>wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derselbig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verricht</unclear> unnd in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethrect</unclear> werden moege <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ferneren</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>inhalts verstanden, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darüber</unclear> aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">betracht</unclear>, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soelliche</unclear> deliberation
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befuegter</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mülhußen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschehen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> wir die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschaffenheit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aller</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sachen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> vil der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ingezognen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verletzten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgern</unclear> noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear>-
<lb n="18"/>handen, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> dem gehorsamen mindern theil von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbigen</unclear> wegen
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angolegen</unclear> unnd zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besinnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirdt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dwyl</unclear> sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alda</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgerliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sitz</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wonung</unclear> haben soellend halltend deßhalb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besser</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathsamer</unclear>, das
<lb n="21"/>wir die vier Stett zuo glich ouch üwer meinung nach üwer unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-73" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Glaruß</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollche</unclear> bottschafft <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vol</unclear>-
<lb n="23"/>komner instruction unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwallt</unclear> dahin gan <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mülhußen</unclear> soellind zu-
<lb n="24"/>samen schicken, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoversicht</unclear> ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werdint</unclear> üch dasselbig gefallen
<lb n="25"/>lassen, so haben wir daruff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angsehen</unclear>, das sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jeze</unclear> <date resp="#ner">künfftig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonntag</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>den .25. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junii</unclear></date> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abents</unclear> in der statt <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Basell</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ankomend</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">morndrig</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>montags mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderen</unclear> gan <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mülhußen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rytten</unclear> soellind <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alda</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allen</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>sachen vermoeg diß befelchs <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnderrichts</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwallts</unclear> so sy von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberkeiten</unclear> haben werdent aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebür</unclear> unnd notturfft nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anze</unclear>-
<lb n="30"/>ordnen, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verrichten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründtlicher</unclear> pitt, ir wellind dasselbig
<lb n="31"/>üweren unnd unnseren getrüwen lieben Eidtgnossen von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-73" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Glaris</placeName>
<lb n="32"/>unnd <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-185" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schaffhußen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürderlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoschryben</unclear>, damit sy by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnuogsamer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zit</unclear>
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> botten abfertigen unnd dieselben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitt</unclear> den üweren unnd unnsern
<lb n="34"/>sich uff obbestimpten tag gan <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bassel</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verfuegen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegind</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dan</unclear> wir zuo
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guotter</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befüerderung</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anschickung</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soellicher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">expedition</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">disser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>meinung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üwern</unclear> unnd unnseren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear>,
<lb n="37"/>der Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bassel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogeschriben</unclear> unnd inen die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuokunfft</unclear> aller vier
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1207_3988.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="38"/>orten bottschafften <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkhuendt</unclear> unnd verhofft haben, uech werde
<lb n="39"/>damitt gfallen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bschehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sijn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wonnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansehen</unclear> nit fuer
<lb n="40"/>unguett, sunders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mengerleij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedencklicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ursachen</unclear>, zum besten
<lb n="41"/>hallten, damitt sind goettlichem schirm <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevolchen</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Datum</unclear> <origDate when="1587-06-20" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">20</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">junij</unclear>
<lb n="42"/>1587</origDate>.
<lb n="43"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-514" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Schultheis unnd rath
<lb n="44"/>der statt Bern</orgName>.
<lb n="45"/>Den fromen fuersichtigen ersamen wijßen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">burger=
<lb n="46"/>meister unnd rath der statt Zuerich</orgName> unnsern innsunders
<lb n="47"/>guetten fruenden unnd vertruwten lieben allt eijdtgnoßen.
